    "flavor_text": {
        "sun": "Legend says a boulder on an icy mountain absorbed the distress and regrets of a stranded mountaineer, giving rise to Glalie.",
        "moon": "Its prey is instantaneously frozen stiff by the cold air it exhales from its huge mouth. While they’re in that frozen state, it gobbles them up.",
        "ultra-sun": "It freezes its prey and chews them whole. However, it prefers to eat Pokémon like Vanillite that are already frozen.",
        "ultra-moon": "Its actual body is a rock that isn’t particularly hard. Glalie absorbs moisture from the air and drapes itself in an armor of ice."
    },
